{"type":"message","id":"4a54ad44","parentId":"6e69245b","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:59:45.428Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering search result parsing**\n\nI'm thinking about how to parse search results. Maybe using regex would simplify things a bit more. It seems like using Bing's RSS could be a straightforward option for this too. I'll need to weigh the pros and cons of both approaches to see which fits best for the task. This could streamline the process. Exploring these options is definitely worth it!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_06ce9f0def2987f90169baafcbd1e08191b3b383203ceb2894\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuq_PKvEVRKwLLFwcu2NCf1YDLh3BgN6n3kX8_0ipP0AHuMUBSlF9wSTsHXmokl0k-c9x2EIaOXJ0q2loHaMEmtA1AO0BRyctjC8pSpv4OeBmW6E_6rKmiimbbEg_c-6lp-phcVulQONphyCALMHD_4DfT5ZHQhOEZOzLYO8h3f7uCM_wDFUdW0vv1PHLpRsU2MTEJF_8CJentKyYoSQDh2MiH57oE_mLUgIOT7Dy-JO1Q58MULEd4OcA7dVIm7jieVHyiNlP2q9hl83CUG5L14ZZ1jGa5crNDMqZ13fNIB4yx1RnFKcSJ0dA2fICCA5tWGUciNlF0AgSzsKnUzNmC_4581d8mGO0sPT8fLoUd2qr-6KWFsTiZefaE4Ckp_JTZLgx_iu6Un1-x4FpErPHzwAEoit_mlOBzJmUdN6vJLf8XygzhXMxWxWP9VQ_iIqwpqoKeRX50QwmXYu0oNriixnWYTRa42-TgI8RqMohc6qfGx7EcjhNUR0DsMg5-JIYU4MOrE9Sz67RYzorWJFaN7-yVjnw7fA0x0OYqxIhG9Bx7adgjDmr-macKD1tRvnm0HXM694VN3_PXGzykcKMD74_0phQ6kho0557GtCVgiyT9C4qmaKFnb_WiCeEL5CPSSGswuvcFrIm6fblRxqb7uok8DplSDDI_QibHBC5LFYJbXJmV02x2MuIsaTKy4aXPHB-rfHbtP1cgnJOJL8Cj5zbEgpj_muRxbkM-lh6CvdGEsixQ34GMCv5v5l0seoydAuZTvLKwxR6URM_K85P6pyHs-pnVN4gJpuZo5V0YtxYApaw65nERRMWSXC5EV8EsyUzYSUDqilHW_cNBDQFV0Yilp7mspv9BE1TwCMN7FUQJwKAwx7S2ArVLBrrYzHXgMid4XV3Cg6L7JJYgAtF619Hhk0KMQjd0FtyejTwGpXYgOA=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering search result parsing**\\n\\nI'm thinking about how to parse search results. Maybe using regex would simplify things a bit more. It seems like using Bing's RSS could be a straightforward option for this too. I'll need to weigh the pros and cons of both approaches to see which fits 